      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        110
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "CAVEAT: Sarvam AI's outbound-calling endpoint path and exact request-body schema could not be independently verified. URL/body here are placeholders - confirm against Sarvam's current API docs and update before going live. Design assumes a bridge-service pattern (like the LiveKit setup): n8n POSTs booking context + callback_url, bridge signs/places the call via Sarvam, then POSTs the result back to callback_url, echoing the booking context alongside confirmed:true|false."
    },
